    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/STATO_0000258 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/STATO_0000258">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/STATO_0000741"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000114 rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">a variable is a data item which can assume any of a set of values, either as determined by an agent or as randomly occuring through observation.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117 xml:lang="en">Alejandra Gonzalez-Beltran</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>Orlaith Burke</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000117 xml:lang="en">Philippe Rocca-Serra</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119 xml:lang="en">STATO</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119 xml:lang="en">adapted from wolfram-alpha (http://www.wolframalpha.com/input/?i=variable) definition 2.

and from Oxford English Dictionary:
http://www.oed.com/view/Entry/221514?redirectedFrom=variable#eid, definition B,1</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:STATO_0000032 xml:lang="en"></obo:STATO_0000032>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">variable</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/STATO_0000741 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/STATO_0000741">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000027"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000114 rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000428"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>A statistical model is defined as a set of mathematical relationships that express assumptions related to the generation of the observed data and that sets constraints for the analysis of the data.
Statistical model components include graphical structures (e.g. directed acyclic graph), equations (e.g. regression model form), components of equations (e.g. covariate term), and distributional assumptions (e.g. regression error distribution)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>Harold Lehmann, Brian S. Alper, Kenneth Wilkins</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>Philippe Rocca-Serra</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <rdfs:label>statistical model component</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
</rdf:RDF>



